        "text_7VxnmT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The SIHOO M18 ergonomic office chair combines ergonomic support, breathable comfort, and adjustable seating features designed for long work hours, home offices, and professional workspaces. From adjustable lumbar support and reclining functions to breathable mesh materials and ergonomic seating adjustments, the M18 is designed to support posture, comfort, and productivity throughout the day.<br/><br/></p>",
